001200*************************************************************
001300*************************************************************
001400**                  S M O D F R T S                        **
001500**                                                         **
001600*D        THIS PROGRAM MODIFIES FREIGHT INFORMATION        **
001700*D        FROM A RECEIVING SLIP.                           **
001800**                                                         **
001900**     RECEIVING SLIP NUMBER IS ENTERED AND VALIDATED.     **
002000**     THE FREIGHT DATA IS BROUGHT TO THE SCREEN AND THE   **
002100**     USER MAY MODIFY ANY DATA.  THE SAME CHECKS ARE      **
002200**     PERFORMED AS WHEN THE RECEIVING SLIP WAS CREATED.   **
002300**                                                         **
002400**     DATABASE UPDATING:                                  **
002500**          1.  DPOFREIGHT  -  UPDATED                     **
002600**          2.  DDAILYTC    -  ADD 351 TRANSACTION RECORD  **
002700**          3.  DDAILYTC    -  ADD 353 TRANSACTION RECORD  **
002800*************************************************************
      *C***********************************************************
      *C 08/28/92  -  JEFF BUNGO   (CONVERSION BUG FIX)
      *C     CHANGED IF STATEMENT TO CLOSE THIRD-PRT IF
      *C     PRINT-PRT-NO IS "NOT" ZEROS.
      *C
      *C 06/06/96      JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXTEND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C
      *C 06/06/96      JEFF BUNGO
      *C     REMOVE ESCAPE SEQUENCES FROM PRINTING AND REFORMAT
      *C     FREIGHT INFO TO PRINT IN 80 COLUMNS.
      *C
      *C 10/30/97      CA YODER
      *C    ADDED CENTURY FOR DATABASE CHANGE TO MCFPCSTERM.
      *C
      *C 08/25/99      CA YODER   AKRON REQUEST.
      *C    ADDED ADDITIONAL INFORMATION FIELD TO PRINTOUT.
      *C
      *C***********************************************************
