033300
033400*************************************************************
033500*      A RECEIVING SLIP NUMBER IS ENTERED BY THE USER       *
033600*      ANDVALIDATED.  THE FREIGHT INFORMATION IS PUT       *
033700*      TO THE SCREEN AND MAY BE MODIFIED.  THE NEW DATA     *
033800*      IS STORED IN THE DATABASE AND TRANSACTIONS 351       *
033900*      AND 353 ARE CREATED.                                 *
034000*************************************************************
034100 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING VIEW-COMAREA,
034200                          MISCELLANEOUS-DATA,
034300                          USER-AREA,
034400                          LANGUAGE-PARMS,
034500                          ESC-NAME.
034600 00-MAIN.
           OPEN INPUT MPORCV-I DPORECD-I DPOFREIGHT-I CARRIER-FILE.
           OPEN I-O   KFRTERMS-O DPOFREIGHT-O DDAILYTC-O DISPLAY-FILE
                      DRCVTRAK-O.
034700     PERFORM 300-MAIN THRU 399-EXIT.
           CLOSE MPORCV-I DPORECD-I DPOFREIGHT-I KFRTERMS-O
                 DPOFREIGHT-O DDAILYTC-O DISPLAY-FILE
                 DRCVTRAK-O CARRIER-FILE.
034800     GOBACK.
034900
035000*************************************************************
035100*         DISPLAY SCREEN REQUESTING RECEIVER NUMBER.        *
035200*************************************************************
035300 300-MAIN.
036400
036500     MOVE RECEIVER    TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE "000" TO DE-RLSE DE-RS.
037900
038000 305-DISPLAY-RECEIVING-SCREEN.
           MOVE SCREEN-BUFFER-RECEIVER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO SCREEN-BUFFER-RECEIVER.

