      *------JSB 03/18/97
      *------IF CARRIER HAS CHANGED...
      *------FIND ANY DRCVTRAK RECORDS FOR RECEIVING SLIP AND UPDATE
      *------CARRIER AND EXPEDITE CARRIER FLAG.
           MOVE DE-PO                           TO  WS-PO.
           MOVE DE-RLSE                         TO  WS-RLSE.
           MOVE DE-RS                           TO  WS-RS.
           MOVE PO-RLSE-RS TO RCVSLIP OF DRCVTRAK-REC-O.
           MOVE ZEROS TO ITEMNO OF DRCVTRAK-REC-O.
           START DRCVTRAK-O KEY NOT < EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
       360-LOOP.
           READ DRCVTRAK-O NEXT INTO BUF-DRCVTRAK
             AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               GO TO 370-UPDATE-DPOFREIGHT.
           IF RCVTRAK-RCV-SLIP NOT = PO-RLSE-RS
               GO TO 370-UPDATE-DPOFREIGHT.
           MOVE CARRIER-BUF TO RCVTRAK-CARRIER.
      *----------CHECK IF CARRIER IS EXPEDITE FREIGHT CARRIER
           MOVE CARRIER-BUF TO KCARCDE OF CARRIER-REC.
           READ CARRIER-FILE
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
           END-READ.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE SPACES TO RCVTRAK-EXPD-CARR
           ELSE
               IF KCAREXP OF CARRIER-REC NOT = "Y "
                   MOVE SPACES TO RCVTRAK-EXPD-CARR
               ELSE
                   MOVE "X" TO RCVTRAK-EXPD-CARR
               END-IF
           END-IF.
           REWRITE DRCVTRAK-REC-O FROM BUF-DRCVTRAK
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
079290           MOVE "REWRITE DRCVTRAK SMODFRTS 360" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
079300           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
