092200         MOVE PRT-Z-BILL-NO TO  PRINT-LINE
092300         MOVE 2             TO  LINE-ADV
092400         PERFORM 900-PRINT-LINE THRU 909-EXIT.
092500*************************************************************
092600*         CLOSE THREE SPOOLFILES AND STOP PRINTERS          *
092700*************************************************************
097400     CLOSE ONLINE-PRT.
097500     IF ACCTG-PRT-NO NOT = ZEROES
098700             CLOSE ACCTG-PRT.
098800
098900     IF PRINT-PRT-NO NOT = ZEROES
097800             CLOSE THIRD-PRT.

      *----------  IF THE USER ENTERS FREIGHT TERMS THAT ARE DIFFERENT
      *            THAN THE TERMS ENTERED ON THE PO, RECORD THAT FACT
           IF TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF = SAVE-PO-TERM
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              PERFORM 800-DIFFERENT-TERMS.
097900
098000     GO TO 300-MAIN.
098100 399-EXIT.  EXIT.
098200
      *----------  ADD THE DIFFERING FREIGHT TERMS TO A KSAM FILE
       800-DIFFERENT-TERMS.
            MOVE SPACES TO KFRTERMS-REC.
            MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE     TO FREIGHT-YMD.
            IF FREIGHT-YY > "70"
                MOVE "19"          TO FREIGHT-CC
            ELSE
                MOVE "20"          TO FREIGHT-CC.
            MOVE FREIGHT-DATE-CN   TO KTERMDAT.
      ****  MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE TO KTERMDAT.
            MOVE DDAILYTC-TIME TO KTERMTIM.
            MOVE PO-VEN-CODE TO KTERMVEN.
            MOVE SAVE-PO TO KTERMPO.
            MOVE SAVE-PO-TERM TO KTERMPOTRM.
            MOVE TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF TO KTERMRCVRT.
            MOVE ZEROES TO COND-WORD.
            WRITE KFRTERMS-REC
                 INVALID KEY MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
            IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
            IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
               MOVE "BAD WRITE OF KFRTERMS" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE KTERMDAT TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               MOVE KTERMPO TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
               MOVE FILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
               PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
098300 900-PRINT-LINE.
098400     WRITE PRINT-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING LINE-ADV LINES.
098500     IF ACCTG-PRT-NO NOT = ZEROES
               MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-ACCTG
098600         WRITE ACCTG-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING LINE-ADV LINES.
098700     IF PRINT-PRT-NO NOT = ZEROES
             MOVE PRINT-LINE TO PRINT-THIRD
098800       WRITE THIRD-RCD BEFORE ADVANCING LINE-ADV LINES.
098900 909-EXIT.  EXIT.
100500
100600 940-VSETERROR.
