103200     MOVE PO-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
103300     MOVE BASE TO BASE.
103400     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
103500           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
103600           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
103700 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
103800
